# Configuration 13 -- a quarter of a billion lines on one ore field.
#
#                        Shared ore network
#                               |
#          +--------------------+--------------------+
#          v                    v                    v
#       Line 1               Line 2      ...    Line 250,000,000
#
# v1 and v2 both leaned on deployed lines never touching each other. That is
# what let T4 answer a billion lines with a handful of phase archetypes: each
# line's trajectory was a function of its own starting phase and nothing else.
# One shared bay deletes that assumption completely. Line 1 and line
# 250,000,000 are now competing for the same ore, and neither can be solved
# without the other.
#
# The compression has to move up a level, and it can -- for exactly one reason.
# With every storage shared there is no per-line state left anywhere in the
# plant. Two lines therefore have nothing that could tell them apart, their
# machines are interchangeable in the same sense two smelters inside one line
# are, and a million lines of four smelters simply *is* one class of four
# million smelters. `SmeltLine x 250,000,000` becomes a population.
#
# The harness checks that claim rather than asserting it: at small line counts
# it builds the plant both ways -- as `n` genuinely separate classes over the
# shared bays, and as one class `n` times as populous -- and requires the two
# to agree on every counter. It also asks what happens when a line is given a
# buffer of its own, which is where the argument is supposed to break.
#
# Supply is deliberately hopeless: 10,000 ore/tick arriving against 500,000,000
# ore/tick of appetite. The point of the configuration is the contention, not
# the throughput.

item IronOre
item IronPlate

blueprint SmeltLine {
    shared storage OreNet    { capacity 2000000  policy round_robin }
    shared source  Field x50 { produces 4000 IronOre every 20 ticks }

    process Smelter x4       { consumes 20 IronOre takes 40 ticks produces 20 IronPlate }

    shared storage PlateNet  { capacity 2000000  policy round_robin }
    shared sink    Yard x40  { consumes 5000 IronPlate every 20 ticks }

    wire Field -> OreNet -> Smelter -> PlateNet -> Yard
}

deploy 250_000_000 x SmeltLine
